COMPILATION OF: E48A14

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48A14

   1 a 0000 E48A14:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1] `if k = 0 & b then'.  [C095] pins the fixed-bin
   4 a 0006      and DECIMAL boolean operands; a BIT(1) operand has no sample,
   5 a 0006      and my `lower_bool' refuses it.  A bit cell is ONE byte, so
   6 a 0006      the 2-byte `= 0' tail cannot read it -- that is exactly why
   7 a 0006      this needs DR's own bytes. */
   8 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('1'b);
   9 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  10 c 0006   k = 0;
  11 c 000C   if k = 0 & b then
  12 c 001E      put list('YES');
  13 c 0038   else
  14 c 0038      put list('NO');
  15 c 004F   stop;
  16 a 0052 end E48A14;

CODE SIZE = 0052
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 3893
END  COMPILATION
